Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the Seal of Auriculcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate the Magic\NCard, Full Armor Gravitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M INVINCIBLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you stand up to this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't access Kaiba's\Nsatellite, we'll never find Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Access granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I got in, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done. Now what's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey needs our help, and he needs it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, you must chill. Tay is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Kaiba's tracking system,\Nwe have no hope of finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one here who\Nunderstands what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey may be losing his\Nsoul as we speak. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think of it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to have faith\Nthat Rebecca can find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, I know Joey\Ncan take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been in tough situations before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This readout's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's not far, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll take\Nthis and track him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You move the trailer to a safer place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:03:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you've made up your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, you keep an eye on\Nthem until we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got our own work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your talents back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, as soon as Joey's\Nsafe, we'll find Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's going to be just fine,\NI promise. Please, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't have a second to lose\NSo go kick some butt and take names Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one way to put it.\NLet's chit-chat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.51,0:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with everything You too\NIf you need us, just call Right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:04:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will be back here safe\Nand sound in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I believe in the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And you should, too. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's having a hard time forgiving\Nthe Pharaoh for what happened to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She must think he'll be\Ntempted by evil again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope she's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna stare at that\Ncard all night, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It works better when you actually\Nplay it. You're even dumber than
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You look. But you asked for it. First\NI summon my Brigadier of Landstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I activate my\NMonster Reborn card And
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using it to bring\Nmy Rocket Warrior back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, I play this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Claw of Hermos!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, I can really prove my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So go, use your dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No monster's too strong for my armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How far is Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few blocks according to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope I'm reading this thing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have played his dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll merge my claw of\Nhammos with my rocket warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My Rocket Hamos Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:06:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect item to help my\NBrigadier of Landstar take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That puny little guy couldn't\Neven put a dent in my armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not looking to make a dent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna blow the whole thing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Brigadier of Landstar,\Nattack with Rocket Hammo's cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Opponent attack unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Probability of armor destruction 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That cannon should have blown\Nthe armor right off his back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm the last\Nman standing, right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be down, but I'm not\Nout, thanks to my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got special abilities, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you destroyed it just now,\Nyou let loose its most devastating one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you hate always\Nbeing one step behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing left\Nand you're about to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still holding my Databrain\Nmagic card. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It activated when you destroyed my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing in my racket, Cannon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.13,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's absorbing information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my data brain is memorizing the precise\Nmolecular structure of your cannon. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:08:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So it can create an exact duplicate of\Nyour weapon on my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember my card that\Nnever goes away, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, this'll jog your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychic Armahead, return!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you're so happy to see it,\NI'll also play another Burning Knuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, things are\Ngoing to be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm upgrading my\Narmor with a new weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the one I just got from you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Hammo's cannon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, this rocket\Ncannon only lasts one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But by the looks of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think one turn was all I needed\Nto knock you down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess this means I win the duel, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Wheeler never gives up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So walk away while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm doing this for Mai, because whether\Nshe knows it or not, she needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And in order to do that, I need to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's even tougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never faced an opponent with\Nthis much determination before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After what I put him through,\Nhe should have given up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to take control of\Nthis duel, so look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake for me to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this one. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any time\Nto shop around anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pay darts a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing in this car?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think we're\Ndoing? We're buying it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nplay games, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this should cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat's taking the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling\NWheeler's in trouble again
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have time to bail that chump\Nout. I have bigger things to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Too weak to make a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so I play this\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess you couldn't find a monster\Nthat was strong enough to take me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.45,0:11:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That means your life\Npoints are wide open, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got just the\Nthing to help me smash
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,them to smithereens and\Nend this duel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my black hole\Nshield in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives my Burning\NKnuckle 200 extra attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,points scanning opponent's\Nplaying field monster cards
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,zero face down cards one\Nsay goodbye to the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of your life points, Wheeler!\NBurning Big Knuckle, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With Iron Fist Uppercut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought you were the only one\Nwith a space suit, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you activated my\NAura Armor Trap Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Detecting rival armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I decided the only way to beat\Nyou was to fight armor with armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, when Aura Armor is on the\Nfield and I get attacked, it activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.89,0:12:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have under 2,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I had to give up half of those\Nlife points in order to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But as an added bonus, I was able\Nto cancel out your last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.35,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And get this snazzy suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try something original, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because nobody likes a\Nwannabe. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My armor's different than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is directly linked to my life\Npoints, so when it gets destroyed, I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's that for original, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round and one more attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Last man standing wins the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I lay one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey must have summoned\Nhis legendary dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why mine was glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did the light fade?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Roll of Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.19,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever number the die lands on,\NI get to pick up that many cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also have to send that\Nmany cards to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this bloke up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm gonna start\Nthings off with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Red-Eyes Transmigration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is sacrifice my\NRed-Eyes Black Dragon, and you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.09,0:14:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.25,0:14:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So I sacrifice my Red-Eyes Black\NDragon and my new Armor card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can play War of the Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, you need a closer look, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of the Red, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way out this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.87,0:15:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Black Hole Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your attack failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By sacrificing my shield, I protected\Nmy life points from any damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my strategy was foolproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved myself, but barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's never happened to\Nme during a battle before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's pushing me\Nto my dueling limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.09,0:16:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the greatest challenge\NI've ever faced. You know what, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, you're putting up quite\Na fight You do, but you know what, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not fighting for fun This\Nis about saving my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just in time to\Ncatch the end of the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,greatest duel ever played You\Nand I had a deal, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheeler's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you've done enough, so why don't\Nyou take a hike and let me finish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having way too much\Nfun out here to stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, this duel is no\Nplace for you. Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you risk\Nlosing everything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I challenged\NWheeler in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get rid of him so you'd\Nbe able to move on with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.79,0:17:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see what you play next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to wait, pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,because I play one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Big mistake, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Monster Reborn,\Nwhich lets me bring back...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bust a pile!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the last attack\Nof the duel, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite! I have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my scapegoat magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Pipsqueaks can't\Nblock my fist of iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a good thing that's not\Nwhat I'm trying to do, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My armor's got a special power, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of the Red is able to\Nautomatically destroy every other
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,monster on the field whenever two\Nmagic cards are played in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Two cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But you only played one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,True, but you played Monster Reborn, which\Ncounts as the second magic card I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're fluffing, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.19,0:18:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way your armor can beat mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Still think I was bluffing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm is gone, but I still\Nhave a few life points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So this duel's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been nice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Extinction fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to\Nneutralize your attack right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,on the spot and rid the field\Nof your Lord of the Red.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, extinction fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a good echo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, I\Nwas one step ahead. Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I gotta hand it to you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both one attack away from defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.91,0:20:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next round, one of them's going\Nto be trapped by the seal forever.
